      "text": "[6:44PM] #Jibowu_Yaba_Oyingbo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdekunle intersection to 3rd Mainland Bridge and Muritala Mohammed Way are moving smoothly.\nMakoko/Panti and Sabo are slightly busy due to traffic light alternation. \nUnilag junction to Jibowu and Freeman Street to Herbert Macaulay Way are also flowing well.\nMarket activities are causing slight delays at Oyingbo inw Ile-Ife. \nOverall, traffic is being managed effectively by our officers. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
