      "text": "[6:52PM] #Vi #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic around Victoria Island is experiencing heavy traffic.\nAhmadu Bello Way is moving relatively well, while others like Eko Hotel roundabout, Law School to Civic Center, and Lekki Phase 1 to Sandfield are experiencing slow movement due to high traffic volume and traffic light delays. \nBonny Camp inw Kofo Abayomi and Kilimanjaro to Kofo are also moving at a slow pace. \nOfficers are on ground managing traffic effectively, ensuring a relatively smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
